# Normalize everything to LF in the git repo, regardless of what a
# contributor's editor or OS checks out. This repo is plain Markdown read by
# both humans and a content validator (scripts/validate-entries.mjs); that
# validator already had to add a CRLF-normalization workaround for Windows
# checkouts (see its "with CRLF line endings" tests) — this closes the gap at
# the source instead of relying on every future text-processing script to
# remember to normalize.
* text=auto eol=lf
